sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 创作者
    participant Editor as Monaco编辑器
    participant FlowPanel as EnhancedFlowChart<br/>(右侧面板)
    participant Parser as ScriptParser
    participant Dagre as Dagre布局引擎
    participant ReactFlow as @xyflow/react

    %% 初始加载
    User->>Editor: 打开项目编辑器
    Editor->>FlowPanel: scriptText = 当前脚本内容
    FlowPanel->>Parser: parse(scriptText)
    Parser-->>FlowPanel: {lines, labelMap, chapterMap, choiceBlocks}
    FlowPanel->>FlowPanel: 将解析结果转为 FlowNode[] + FlowEdge[]
    FlowPanel->>Dagre: 计算自动布局坐标
    Dagre-->>FlowPanel: 每个节点的x/y位置
    FlowPanel->>ReactFlow: setNodes(nodes), setEdges(edges)
    ReactFlow-->>FlowPanel: 渲染流程图
    FlowPanel-->>User: 显示节点连线图

    %% 实时刷新
    User->>Editor: 编辑脚本（新增 @label scene2 / @jump label=scene2）
    Editor->>FlowPanel: onChange 触发，300ms 防抖
    FlowPanel->>Parser: parse(updatedScriptText)
    Parser-->>FlowPanel: 新解析结果
    FlowPanel->>FlowPanel: 检测无效跳转 + 孤立标签
    FlowPanel->>Dagre: 重新布局
    Dagre-->>FlowPanel: 新坐标
    FlowPanel->>ReactFlow: updateNodes, updateEdges
    ReactFlow-->>FlowPanel: 流程图更新
    FlowPanel-->>User: 实时更新的流程图

    %% 点击跳转
    User->>ReactFlow: 单击某节点
    ReactFlow->>FlowPanel: onNodeClick(node)
    FlowPanel->>FlowPanel: 获取 node.data.lineIndex
    FlowPanel->>Editor: dispatchEvent(galgame-goto-line, {line: lineIndex+1})
    Editor->>Editor: 滚动到对应行 + 添加高亮装饰
    Editor-->>User: 编辑器定位到该行
